MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:9639c5e141'}) SET n.text = 'KGF and Salaar are not set in the same continuity. KGF takes place around the Kolar Gold Fields; Salaar takes place in the entirely separate fictional city-state of Khansaar. There is no canonical crossover or shared timeline between them. What connects the three projects (KGF, Salaar, Dragon) is Prashanth Neel as director and, for KGF and Salaar, composer Ravi Basrur — not a shared narrative universe. Any claim that these films form one connected continuity is a fan/media narrative, not something confirmed by the filmmaker.';
MERGE (n:Document {id: 'doc:Dragon (Prashanth Neel, unreleased as of September 2026)'}) SET n.name = 'Dragon (Prashanth Neel, unreleased as of September 2026)';
MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:0325e1a1d2'}) SET n.text = 'Universe note: despite fan speculation, Prashanth Neel has explicitly and publicly stated that Dragon has no direct narrative connection to KGF or Salaar — no shared characters, setting, or continuity. He has instead described it as the concluding film of his "mass-action trilogy" in tone and directorial style, not in shared story-world.';
