MERGE (n:Question {id: 'question:ans-04'}) SET n.text = 'Who sends Rocky to take over KGF?', n.category = 'answerable';
MERGE (n:Run {id: 'run:c5e364de2a09'}) SET n.latency_ms = 2663.369, n.cost_usd = 0.00036314999999999996;
MERGE (n:Answer {id: 'answer:c5e364de2a09'}) SET n.text = 'Shivanna, the Mumbai crime boss, sends Rocky to seize control of KGF【KGF: Chapter 1 (2018)】', n.passed = true;
MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:e1edcbfcfb'}) SET n.text = 'Plot: Rocky now secretly controls KGF and its gold output, disguising the operation as a legitimate mining company. His hold is threatened on two fronts: Adheera, a scarred, near-mythic warlord who served the mine\'s original owners and wants revenge and control back, and Ramika Sen, a corrupt and ruthless Prime Minister who wants to expose and seize the illegal gold operation for political gain. A journalist, framed as the narrator piecing Rocky\'s story together after the fact, drives much of the film\'s structure. Rocky defeats Adheera in a large-scale final battle, but the film closes with Rocky\'s own death, orchestrated by the political forces that could not defeat him by force.';
MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:7e7a9520ba'}) SET n.text = 'Plot: Rocky is born into poverty in Mumbai\'s slums. After his mother dies, having made him promise as a child that he would become the most powerful and wealthiest man alive, he rises through the city\'s criminal underworld through sheer ruthlessness and cunning. A crime boss, Shivanna, sends Rocky to seize control of KGF and eliminate its violent overseer, Garuda, who has ruled the mine and its enslaved workers with total brutality for decades. Rocky infiltrates KGF, gradually wins the loyalty of the laborers by defying Garuda\'s regime, and in a final confrontation kills Garuda, taking control of the gold fields for himself. The film ends with Rocky now the secret, unchallenged ruler of KGF\'s gold wealth.';
MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:f0fbd3ade4'}) SET n.text = 'Key characters: Rocky (protagonist), Garuda (antagonist, former ruler of KGF), Shivanna (Mumbai crime boss who sends Rocky).';
MERGE (n:Claim {id: 'claim:c5e364de2a09:0'}) SET n.text = 'Shivanna, a Mumbai crime boss, sends Rocky to seize control of KGF.', n.supported = true;
