MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:81b0b8e267'}) SET n.text = 'Key characters: Deva (protagonist), Vardharaja "Varadha" (Deva\'s childhood friend, heir to Khansaar), several unnamed Khansaar faction leaders.';
MERGE (n:Chunk {id: 'chunk:2a348eaba2'}) SET n.text = 'Plot: Deva and Vardharaja ("Varadha") grow up as inseparable childhood friends until a violent incident tears their families apart and separates them. Years later, Varadha is next in line to inherit control of Khansaar, but a brutal succession war breaks out among the city\'s rival factions as rulership becomes contested. Deva, who has deliberately kept away from Khansaar and its politics, is pulled back in when Varadha calls on him in a moment of crisis. Much of the film traces Deva\'s transformation from a reluctant outsider into Varadha\'s fiercely loyal, devastatingly effective protector. The film ends on a cliffhanger mid-conflict, explicitly setting up a second part.';
